    {
      "source": "Inserts the given entities. Assumes the instance to be new to be able to apply insertion optimizations. Use the\nreturned instance for further operations as the save operation might have changed the entity instance completely.\nPrefer using <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/reactive/ReactiveCrudRepository.html#save(S)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.reactive\"><code>ReactiveCrudRepository.save(Object)</code></a> instead to avoid the usage of store-specific API.",
      "translation": "插入给定的实体。假设该实例为新建实例，以便应用插入优化。请使用返回的实例进行后续操作，因为保存操作可能会完全更改实体实例。建议改用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/reactive/ReactiveCrudRepository.html#save(S)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.reactive\"><code>ReactiveCrudRepository.save(Object)</code></a> 以避免使用特定于存储的 API。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Inserts the given entities.",
      "translation": "插入给定的实体。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>entities</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>entities</code> - 不能为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all entities matching the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> applying the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>. In case no match could be\nfound an empty <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a> is returned. <br/>\nBy default the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> uses typed matching restricting it to probe assignable types. For example, when\nsticking with the default type key (<code>_class</code>), the query has restrictions such as\n<code>_class : { $in : [com.acme.Person] }</code>. <br/>\nTo avoid the above mentioned type restriction use an <a href=\"../core/query/UntypedExampleMatcher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>UntypedExampleMatcher</code></a> with\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html#of(T,org.springframework.data.domain.ExampleMatcher)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example.of(Object, org.springframework.data.domain.ExampleMatcher)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回所有匹配给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> 并应用给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 的实体。如果未找到匹配项，则返回一个空的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a>。<br/>\n默认情况下，<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> 使用类型匹配，将其限制为可探测的赋值类型。例如，当坚持使用默认类型键 (<code>_class</code>) 时，查询具有如下限制：<code>_class : { $in : [com.acme.Person] }</code>。<br/>\n为避免上述提到的类型限制，请使用 <a href=\"../core/query/UntypedExampleMatcher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>UntypedExampleMatcher</code></a> 配合 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html#of(T,org.springframework.data.domain.ExampleMatcher)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example.of(Object, org.springframework.data.domain.ExampleMatcher)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all entities matching the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>. In case no match could be found an empty <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a> is\nreturned. <br/>\nBy default the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> uses typed matching restricting it to probe assignable types. For example, when\nsticking with the default type key (<code>_class</code>), the query has restrictions such as\n<code>_class : { $in : [com.acme.Person] }</code>. <br/>\nTo avoid the above mentioned type restriction use an <a href=\"../core/query/UntypedExampleMatcher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>UntypedExampleMatcher</code></a> with\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html#of(T,org.springframework.data.domain.ExampleMatcher)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example.of(Object, org.springframework.data.domain.ExampleMatcher)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回所有与给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>匹配的实体。如果未找到匹配项，则返回一个空的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a>。<br/>\n默认情况下，<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>使用类型匹配，将其限制为可探测的赋值类型。例如，当坚持使用默认类型键（<code>_class</code>）时，查询具有如下限制：<code>_class : { $in : [com.acme.Person] }</code>。<br/>\n为避免上述提到的类型限制，请使用<a href=\"../core/query/UntypedExampleMatcher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>UntypedExampleMatcher</code></a>配合<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html#of(T,org.springframework.data.domain.ExampleMatcher)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example.of(Object, org.springframework.data.domain.ExampleMatcher)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
